     "type": "text-editor",
     "id": "3e0bd30b",
     "text": "Pomegranate Is a nearly round medium to large fruit. It’s layered with a deep pink leathery skin, the interior has white, spongy, bitter tissue into compartments packed with sacs filled with sweetly acid, juicy, dark pink tiny seeds. The seeds are entirely edible, crunchy, sweet and berry-like in flavor.",
     "html": "<h3><span> <b>Pomegranate</b><br/></span></h3><h3><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 400;\"> <span>Is a nearly round medium to large fruit. It’s layered with a deep pink leathery skin, the interior has white, spongy, bitter tissue into compartments packed with sacs filled with sweetly acid, juicy, dark pink tiny seeds. The seeds are entirely edible, crunchy, sweet and berry-like in flavor.</span><span><br/></span></span></h3>"
    },
